00:13:02.130 --> 00:13:04.100
So the trial court
technically is the only court

00:13:04.100 --> 00:13:05.910
that can take on new facts.

00:13:05.910 --> 00:13:07.060
People get this wrong all the time.

00:13:07.060 --> 00:13:08.470
They say, "oh, I'm going
to appeal something,"

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:11.180
